{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30372","headline":"和令狐补阙春日独游西街 · 赵嘏","name":"和令狐补阙春日独游西街","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"左掖初辞近侍班，马嘶寻得过街闲。\n映鞭柳色微遮水，随步花枝欲碍山。\n暖泛鸟声来席上，醉从诗句落人间。\n此时失意哀吟客，更觉风流不可攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}